    metaTitle: 'High-Yield Savings Accounts Explained | Money Director',
    metaDescription: 'Discover how high-yield savings accounts work, why they pay more than traditional savings, and how to choose the best one for your money.',
    slug: 'high-yield-savings-accounts-explained',
